      "text": "The ice mephit breathes shards of ice in a 15-foot cone that deals 1d6 cold damage and 1d6 piercing damage to each creature within the area (DC 17 basic Reflex save save).\n\nThe ice mephit can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds."
